ugh that and  I enjoyed the challenge enjoyed the  entrepreneurial spirit but still when I  graduated high school when they asked  you in your yearbook you know what do  you want to be when you you know in 10  years what do you see yourself I said I  would be a VP at some invest  bang that was still my goal I guess  getting out of high school and it  changed in university I had an  opportunity to partner up with two  people who are at my university and they  had started a software company biotech  software they needed help getting it off  the ground they had a great piece of  software but needed help promoting it  marketing it I didn't know anything  about software I didn't run over biotech  and I i joined in to help them just as a  fun thing to do new experience see what  happens and it got to the point where  you guys have heard this story probably  watched my channel for a whiles make it  300 bucks a month you know barely  surviving with this company and I had  opportunities to go work with with two  companies who were in investment banking  in strategic consulting things that I  would have loved to do like that was my  that was what I thought I wanted to do  with my life and they were courting me  and they flew mid in New York and put me  up in nice hotels and you know why  didn't dine me offering 80 $100,000  starting salary traveling around the  world doing lots of fun cool things that  jobs that that my friends were were  killing for jobs that even you know two  years ago would have been wow I can't  believe I got this opportunity it's so  great and I had to decide between taking  these you know high-paying dream job of  a lifetime and continuing with the  business that I had joined as an owner I  make it 300 bucks a month and rationally  it makes sense that go for the job right  like everything leads you towards a job  it's it's stable that secure it's tons  of money it's what I always wanted it's  travel it's it's like the dream  opportunity and yet something in my mind  was just telling me I want to like I  feel there's more out of my business I  feel like I feel like I could turn this  thing around I feel like it can become  something great I feel like I really  felt like I would regret it for the rest  of my life if I didn't at least try yeah  I didn't want to leave it in the  situation where was just struggling to  get by and I would  Brett that I didn't give it my best and  I had a really hard time with it I  struggled and and I making that decision  of what camp to go with and what I  finally came down to was it's you know  I'm gonna I'm gonna take a year so my  friends were taking a year off out of  after graduating University explore the  world doing whatever and I thought you  know what those jobs may not be those  specific jobs the job opportunities will  still be available for me in a year if I  go trying something and come back but I  felt once I got on that corporate track  then be super hard to jump off it takes  a lot of guts and courage to leave a  corporate track once you're on and once  you start having family and other  commitments and I'm huge mortgage to pay  all that stress that's what gave me the  confidence to focus on my business I  said I'll do it for a year and it can  come back I can always go back and I  never went back and I think that was a  defining moment for me making that  decision that was a moment where I felt  like I am an entrepreneur and I'm so  glad that I took that path and and wish  I could say that I was simple of course  young entrepreneur just makes sense but  but I was scared I was nervous I didn't  know if it was the right thing to do I  lost sleep I was stressed out over it  but I listened to my heart instead of my  head in that moment and it paid off so  that was a moment that I decided to  become an entrepreneur thank you for the  question and let me share that with you  guys today if you guys like this video  please give it a thumbs up below I'd  love to hear your story how did you  decide to be an entrepreneur leave it in  the comments below or if you have a  question for me you can leave it below  make a video response and don't forget  to click on my face and subscribe to the  channel thank you guys so much and I'll  see you soon  you
 

